# Literal RH completion cutset

This bundle contains the merged Riemann Hermitian top-down tranche from
`dashi_agda`, including:

- `DASHI/Analysis/RiemannHermitianTopDownAssemblyExact.agda`;
- complex-Poisson/Hermitian reduction;
- phi/cosh coercivity reduction;
- finite-retention and mixed-kernel envelope reductions;
- the Riemann analytic substrate and exact theorem surface.

The material is a proof programme and reduction ledger, not a proof of the
Riemann hypothesis.  It includes the later committed
`RiemannG3SourceTransportExact.agda` and
`RiemannCenteredGridRetentionExact.agda` updates.  Their source assumptions
and proof status must still be checked; their presence is not a proof that the
literal analytic obligations are discharged.
